---
const challenges = [
  ["Finding the right problem to solve.", "Most ideas fail because they solve something nobody urgently needs."],
  ["Identifying and refining the ideal customer profile.", "Knowing exactly who you serve changes everything that follows."],
  ["Validating ideas with real prospects.", "Opinions are cheap. Evidence from real conversations is not."],
  ["Building the right product.", "Software, a physical product or a service: the hard part is building what people will pay for."],
  ["Finding and acquiring customers.", "A great offer still needs people to discover it and say yes."],
  ["Managing sales, marketing and operations.", "Every function competes for the same hours in your day."],
  ["Managing cash flow and surviving financially.", "Runway decides how long you get to keep trying."],
  ["Growing without a large team.", "The work grows faster than one person can."],
];
---

<section class="section problem" id="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">The problem</p>
      <h2 class="h2" id="problem-title">
        Starting a business is hard. <span class="serif">Running it alone is harder.</span>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <ol class="problem__list">
      {challenges.map(([title, detail], i) => (
        <li class="problem__item" data-reveal>
          <span class="problem__num">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="h3">{title}</h3>
            <p class="muted">{detail}</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>

    <blockquote class="problem__close" data-reveal>
      <p>
        Entrepreneurs don't lack ambition. They lack the resources, time and team to turn their
        ambition into a <span class="gradient-text">sustainable business.</span>
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem__list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    column-gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    counter-reset: none;
  }

  .problem__item {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 52px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .problem__item p {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .problem__num {
    color: var(--indigo);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .problem__close {
    max-width: 30ch;
    margin: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px) 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .problem__list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .problem__item {
      grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr);
      padding: 22px 0;
    }
  }
</style>
